WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:01.890
We have a voicemail number.

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:03.729
That number is two one nine two.

00:00:03.729 --> 00:00:09.809
David P. Here is a question I'm increasingly
getting about the possibility of mandatory

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:11.059
covid vaccinations.

00:00:11.059 --> 00:00:12.110
Take a listen.

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:16.690
Hi, David, this is Talia from North Carolina.

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:21.840
My question is, with the vaccine getting rolled
out and Biden making it one of his priorities,

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.360
what do you think will happen with mandatory
vaccines for kids in schools?

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:29.720
Because I know that there's many vaccines
that the government has made mandatory for

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:32.340
people to go to school.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:38.100
So do you think Biden will have to decide
on that?

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.960
So, no, Joe Biden is not going to have to
decide on that decisions about vaccine requirements

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:48.140
for attending public school are typically
made at the state level.

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:52.260
They may even be made at a more local level,
but typically those are state level decisions.

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:55.359
I think we need to be really careful with
our terminology here.

00:00:55.359 --> 00:01:01.809
A mandatory vaccine is a vaccine that you
are required to have.

00:01:01.809 --> 00:01:08.390
Rather than simply one that you can choose
to have if you want to participate in a certain

00:01:08.390 --> 00:01:12.920
activity or avail yourself of a certain business
service or educational institution.

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:15.619
So it's really important that we be clear
with the language.

00:01:15.619 --> 00:01:20.000
The coronavirus vaccine is not going to be
mandatory in the sense that no government,

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:25.289
state, local, federal, is going to force anyone
who doesn't want a vaccine to get one.

00:01:25.289 --> 00:01:31.820
What we are going to see, and we're already
hearing from it, is that everything from airlines

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:40.540
to yes, maybe schools will say if you or your
kid want to travel with us, come to a concert,

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:46.149
Live Nation, Ticketmaster, or talking about
this, maybe attend our school, which is your

00:01:46.149 --> 00:01:48.689
choice to do or not to do.

00:01:48.689 --> 00:01:50.640
You would be required to be vaccinated.

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:52.520
Now, you don't have to be vaccinated.

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:55.130
You just might not be able to fly JetBlue.

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:56.310
Maybe Delta will allow you.

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:58.679
I think Delta already said they're going to
require vaccinations.

00:01:58.679 --> 00:02:01.399
This is hypothetical at a private school.

00:02:01.399 --> 00:02:05.679
Could also say at this school you have to
have a coronavirus vaccine to attend.

00:02:05.679 --> 00:02:10.929
Some private schools have laxer rules on vaccination
than public schools.

00:02:10.929 --> 00:02:11.929
Some don't.

00:02:11.929 --> 00:02:17.430
So it's really important that we not fall
into this idea of a vaccine made mandatory

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:19.349
by a government.

00:02:19.349 --> 00:02:23.420
Public schools are run by states and municipalities.

00:02:23.420 --> 00:02:26.170
They're not going to force a vaccine on anyone.

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:32.260
But they may say if you choose to send your
kid to the school, they must have a vaccine,

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:36.709
as is already the case with a number of different
vaccines in different states and municipalities.

00:02:36.709 --> 00:02:43.150
So let's take control of what this actually
is, which are requirements for participation

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:48.880
as as they exist in many different areas across
many different industries.

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:56.530
And I do expect that many businesses, because
of the risk to their business of coronavirus

00:02:56.530 --> 00:03:01.860
outbreaks, will have a variety of different
guidelines that say if you want to fly with

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:08.710
us or travel on our train or whatever employers
might say, we require employees to be vaccinated

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:09.900
for this or that.

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:11.569
You don't have to work here.

00:03:11.569 --> 00:03:12.569
Working here is optional.

00:03:12.569 --> 00:03:14.260
You can go to a different employer if you
want.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:19.060
But to work here, you need this vaccine or
that vaccine fully expect that that is going

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:20.060
to happen.

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:25.459
It'll be up to people to decide whether they
want to avail themselves of a certain school

00:03:25.459 --> 00:03:31.620
or of a certain airline or whatever, enough
that they will choose to go and get that vaccine.

